{"id":"anklage","lemma":"Anklage","pos":"noun","rank":1849,"glosses":["charge","accusation"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/De-Anklage.ogg/De-Anklage.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Anklage","plural":"Anklagen"},"formAudio":{"Anklagen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-anklagen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wie genau lautet die Anklage?","en":"What exactly are the charges?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"just, exactly"},{"g":"to be, to read","l":"lauten"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Anklage wurde fallen gelassen.","en":"The charge was dropped.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to fall, to drop"},{"g":"calm"}]},{"text":"Er verneinte die Anklage.","en":"He denied the accusation.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich möchte Sie bitten, die Anklage fallen zu lassen.","en":"I'd like you to drop the charges.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to ask"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to fall, to drop"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to allow"}]},{"text":"Die Anklage gegen ihn wurde vollständig fallengelassen.","en":"He was completely cleared of the charge against him.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"against"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"complete"},null]}]}